// The tier-two precision component for power and transport infrastructure.
//
// The sharpest single expression of "depth within rules". Until M5 the
// Alloy and poles become switches, bearings and governors: cell-bank
// racks, busbars and lift upgrades consume them. The basic elevator
// remains rope-gated so transport can exist inside one run; mechanisms
// deepen and harden infrastructure rather than hiding the first shaft.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
ItemDef(
    id: "item.mechanisms",
    name: "Mechanisms",
    glyph: "🛠",
    order: 40,
)
